I have uploaded Linux binaries for GNU Emacs 19.7 to:
    sunsite.unc.edu
    tsx-11.mit.edu

Please get emacs-19.7-A.Notes if you want the Linux-specific patches and
instructions on how to build Emacs 19.7 from the source distribution.  The
patches should be in the next distribution.

Please get the following gzip'd tar files to install the binary release:
    emacs-19.7-A.bin.1of5.tar.z                 binaries
    emacs-19.7-A.bin.2of5.tar.z                 binaries
    emacs-19.7-A.bin.3of5.tar.z                 mostly lisp
    emacs-19.7-A.bin.4of5.tar.z                 mostly lisp
    emacs-19.7-A.bin.5of5.tar.z                 mostly lisp

