        /lib/libX11.so.3 (DLL Jump 3.0pl0)
        /libc.so.4 (DLL Jump 4.3pl3)
        /libm.so.4 (DLL Jump 4.3pl3)

In my haste, I probably did not strip the binaries.  You can strip them.
The next binary release will have them stripped.

The binary gets installed in /usr/bin/emacs-19.7, so it will not over-write
/usr/bin/emacs.

The libraries and support files are in /usr/lib/emacs, so it will not
over-write /usr/emacs.

